# A trip instance is personal data of an unusual kind: a stay window discloses
# when a home stands empty, and a lodging discloses where its occupant is. Both
# are published in advance, attached to a real identity, and useful to exactly
# the wrong people.
#
# Nothing here is tracked except the fictional demo used as the public
# end-to-end fixture, and this directory's own scaffolding.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!demo-*.yaml
